{"id":"forest-dew","name":{"en":"Forest Dew","ja":"森の雫"},"desc":{"en":"Only a few drops of this essence can be extracted from a giant tree. Though really difficult to gather, its medicinal effects are phenomenal.","ja":"一本の大木から数滴しか採れない特殊な木の エキスをまとめたもの。集めるのが非常に面 倒くさいが、その面倒くささを補って余りあ る程の有効な薬用成分が凝縮されている。"},"level":9,"locations":[{"id":"arland-new-world","name":{"en":"Arland New World","ja":"アーランド新天地"}},{"id":"grune-rainforest","name":{"en":"Grune Rainforest","ja":"グリューネ雨林"},"parent":"primordial-island"}],"traits":{"id":"healing-essence","name":{"en":"Healing Essence","ja":"癒しのエキス"}},"categories":[{"id":"elixir","name":{"en":"(Elixir)","ja":"（エリキシル）"},"icon":"totori-category-elixir"},{"id":"liquid","name":{"en":"(Liquid)","ja":"（液体）"},"icon":"totori-category-liquid"},{"id":"mystery","name":{"en":"(Mystery)","ja":"（神秘の力）"},"icon":"totori-category-mystery"},{"id":"supplement","name":{"en":"(Supplement)","ja":"（中和剤）"},"icon":"totori-category-supplement"}],"item_type":"Ingredient","index":93}